@inherits ContentPageBase
@page "/projects/experiments/{Slug}"
@page "/pt-BR/projects/experiments/{Slug}"
@using Blog.Blazor.Core

<PageTitle>@Title</PageTitle>
<SeoHead Title="@Title"
    Description="@Description"
    CanonicalPath="@CanonicalPath"
    OgType="article"
    PublishedTime="@PublishedAt" />

<SitePage Template="project-detail"
    data-page-state="@(Experiment is null ? "not-found" : "content")">
    <SiteBreadcrumb HomeUrl="@LocalizedPath("home")"
        HomeLabel="@(L["home"])"
        Links="@BreadcrumbLinks"
        CurrentLabel="@Title" />

    @if (Snapshot is null)
    {
        <SiteHero Title="@(L["loading_content"])" />
    }
    else if (Experiment is null)
    {
        <SiteHero Title="@(L["experiment_not_found"])" Lead="@NotFoundDescription" />
    }
    else
    {
        <SiteHero Title="@Experiment.Name"
            Lead="@Experiment.Purpose"
            BackHref="@LocalizedPath("projects")"
            BackLabel="@(L["projects"])">
            <ChildContent>
                <PublishedUpdatedMeta PublishedAt="@PublishedAt"
                    UpdatedAt="@Experiment.UpdatedAt" />
            </ChildContent>
            <Actions>
            <ContentActions Title="@Experiment.Name"
                Url="@CanonicalPath"
                Body="@(Experiment.Body ?? Experiment.Purpose ?? string.Empty)"
                ExternalUrl="@Experiment.Href" />
            </Actions>
        </SiteHero>

        @if (Experiment.Technologies is { Count: > 0 })
        {
            <SiteChipGroup Class="mb-3"
                data-layout-region="tags">@foreach (var technology in Experiment.Technologies) { <SiteChip Label="@technology.Name"
                    Href="@LocalizedPath($"technologies/{technology.Slug}")" /> }</SiteChipGroup>
        }
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Experiment.Href))
        {
            <SiteLink Class="site-inline-action"
                data-layout-region="source"
                Variant="SiteButtonVariant.Outline"
                Size="SiteButtonSize.Sm"
                Href="@Experiment.Href"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">@(L["external_source"])</SiteLink>
        }

        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Experiment.Body)) { <SiteRichText Html="@((MarkupString)MarkdownRenderer.ToHtml(Experiment.Body))"
            Region="content-footer" /> }
        <ContentHistory ShowHistory="@Experiment.ShowHistory"
            History="@Experiment.History"
            DiffField="body" />
        <ContentRelations CurrentUrl="@CanonicalPath" />
        <RelatedContent Items="@Experiment.Related" />
    }
</SitePage>
